{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10089","headline":"酬于侍郎湖南见寄十四韵 · 包佶","name":"酬于侍郎湖南见寄十四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂岭千崖断，湘流一派通。\n长沙今贾傅，东海旧于公。\n章甫经殊俗，离骚继雅风。\n金闺文作字，玉匣气成虹。\n翰墨时招侣，丹青夙在公。\n主恩留左掖，人望积南宫。\n巧拙循名异，浮沈顾位同。\n九迁归上略，三已契愚衷。\n责谢庭中吏，悲宽塞上翁。\n楚材欣有适，燕石愧无功。\n山晓重岚外，林春苦雾中。\n雪花翻海鹤，波影倒江枫。\n去札频逢信，回帆早挂空。\n避贤方有日，非敢爱微躬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"包佶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}